  "title": "Dry Rub for All Occasions",
  "description": "This is a dry rub that can be used on all meats, fish and vegetables. It is slightly sweet with brown sugar and has a hint of heat from white pepper, red pepper, and mace. Use this for grilling, barbequing meats, or smoking.",
