  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place the cumin, ground coriander, curry powder, white pepper, ground ginger, allspice, cayenne pepper, seasoned salt, paprika, brown sugar, dry mustard, ground mace, and crushed rosemary in a food processor. Process the spice mixture until thoroughly blended. Store in an airtight container at room temperature.",
